<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #16263F 0%, #1E3A5F 100%)',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: -60, right: -60, width: 260, height: 260, borderRadius: 130, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.1)' }} />

  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 2, width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 14 }}>CHAPTER 03 · 看见与控制</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 28 }}>先跑通，再上框架，避免过度设计</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginBottom: 26 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.2)', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 26px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 10 }}>四步循环</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          接收指令 → 思考 → 执行 → 观察 → 判断<br />所有框架的本质
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.2)', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 26px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 10 }}>三板斧治失忆</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          滑动窗口 / 上下文压缩 / 外部记忆<br />记忆靠主动管理
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.2)', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 26px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 10 }}>可观测性</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          ResultMessage 读停止原因<br />effort 控制成本
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,159,28,0.3)', borderRadius: 14, padding: '22px 26px', marginBottom: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF9F1C', marginBottom: 10 }}>动手练习</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
        用任意 SDK 跑通一个带工具调用的 Agent，在日志里找到 Tool Use 与 Tool Result 的交替，并记录 ResultMessage 的停止原因。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
        自测 3 题：四步循环是什么？终止策略有哪两种？上下文满了怎么防失忆？
      </Text>
